; @file   script_06.asm
; @brief  Building NPC schedule variant for hurricane days (the weather forecast says hurricane, or strcFlags.event1 bit
;         $0020 is set): the villagers stay indoors and comment on the storm. Slots 0-6 mirror script_01 for the mayor's
;         house, church, flower shop, tool shop, restaurant, fortune teller and animal shop.
; @bank   $B3   (AI byte code; script id $06, slot table generated by tools/ai/aidata.py from defs/ai/scripts.json)
; @see    script_01 script_04 script_07 script_08 docs/ai/commands.md
;;



